// but # preserves first-occurrence order, so "listen" and "silent" both become "liten")
q)same_chars`listen;`silent
1b

// Different distinct characters
q)same_chars`hello;`world
0b

// Same characters, different counts (handled correctly by distinct)
q)same_chars`book;`cook
1b
```

